---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact me" description="Ways to get in touch with Maciek Palmowski">
  <article class="container mx-auto max-w-[1400px] grid grid-cols-1 justify-start gap-8">
    <div class="w-full max-w-3xl grid grid-cols-1 gap-7 px-5">
      <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-6xl font-bold font-palmiak-font-title m-0 leading-tight text-white">Contact me</h1>
      <hr class="gradient-line" />
    </div>

    <div class="px-5 prose-post max-w-3xl w-full">
      <p>If you want to contact me, there are a few ways to do so:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>write me an email - at <a href="mailto:hi@maciekpalmowski.dev">hi@maciekpalmowski.dev</a></li>
        <li>go to Twitter and send me a DM - <a href="https://twitter.com/palmiak_fp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@palmiak_fp</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
